# Pre-PR quality checks

Before **`git push`** for a pull request, or when the user asks to **open/create a PR**, run these in order and fix any failures in the changed code:

```sh
npm run lint
npm run format:check
npm run typecheck
npm test
npm run build
```

If `format:check` fails, run `npm run format` and include the formatting in the same commit.

Do not open a PR until lint (no errors), format check, typecheck, tests, and build all pass. CI runs the same steps (see `CONTRIBUTING.md`).
